# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# Without this, an editor or shell that writes CRLF on Windows produces a
# whole-file diff for a one-line change, which hides the real change in
# noise. The working tree is checked out with LF; Windows tools that need
# CRLF add it themselves.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending translated.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.fbx binary
*.blend binary
*.gz binary
